<title>USA: ServiceMaster buys Rollins units.</title>
<headline>ServiceMaster buys Rollins units.</headline>
<dateline>DOWNERS GROVE, Ill. 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>ServiceMaster LP said Thursday it purchased from Rollins Inc, Orkin's Plantscaping and Lawn Care divisions for an undisclosed amount of cash.</p>
<p>ServiceMaster said the acquisition will expand meaningfully TruGreen-ChemLawn, its largest and most profitable business unit, by adding 65,000 customers and nearly doubling the size of its plantscaping operations.</p>
<p>TruGreen-ChemLawn provides lawn and landscape service to more than three million customers at over 324 service centers.</p>
<p>			 ((Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8787))</p>
</text>
